      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper reviews the work of the cardiology Service of the Hospital de Basurto de Bilbao on hypertensive cardiomyopathy, diastolic disfunction and exercise tolerance, presenting a new pathophysiologic classification and the possibility of altering the underlying functional factors. The paper also reviews the presentation and evolution of microvascular angina in hypertensive patients."},
